при компоновке." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)  ) (justify left top)) (uuid "37e0c81f-2f30-4846-9abb-bd66c024cc1b")) (embedded_fonts no))